  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "lapdm: Fix frame format type decision",
  "description": "According to TS 100 938 (section 2.1) only UI frames can be from B4 format.\n\nIn the previous implementation, all downlink SACCH was considered from B4 format, \n\nwhich caused some communication (like SMS over SACCH) to be parsed incorrectly due to mistaking the B format length field as the first byte of the packet)",
